{
  "id": "anc-006",
  "description": "(0.5.0, conditional) The RFC-ACDP-0016 §6 verification hook for the seam.decision scheme. A scheme-aware verifier recomputes the Seam record digest v4 from a disclosed sealed record and compares it to the anchor's content_hash. The construction is owned and versioned by Seam, not ACDP (registries/anchor-schemes.md); this fixture pins the scheme owner's published known-answer vectors so a Seam-aware ACDP verifier can test its hook. A verifier that does not resolve seam.decision anchors is unaffected and follows anc-005.",
  "tags": [
    "anchors",
    "verification",
    "scheme-aware",
    "seam",
    "0.5.0"
  ],
  "applies_to_profiles": [
    "acdp-consumer"
  ],
  "input": {
    "source": {
      "scheme_owner": "Seam (zer07labs/seam-runtime)",
      "release_tag": "seam-api-v0.48.0",
      "commit": "32f8196ca41432e04617713048db02c8e07a843c",
      "construction": "https://github.com/zer07labs/seam-runtime/blob/seam-api-v0.48.0/docs/specs/seam-event.v1.md#record-digest",
      "vector_file": "https://github.com/zer07labs/seam-runtime/blob/seam-api-v0.48.0/crates/seam-client/tests/conformance_vectors.json",
      "vector_file_sha256": "4b944ff116c2885ee52bf29ecbea39eba7b3574607bf6bb0b356c4c99cecf022",
      "note": "inputs and digest_hex are copied verbatim from the vector file at the tagged commit. preimage_hex was recomputed independently from the spec text (frame(x) = le32(len(x)) || x; opt(x) = 0x00 or 0x01 || frame(x)) and reproduces digest_hex for both vectors."
    },
    "retrieved_body_summary": "A valid, signed body whose anchors array carries the anchor shown in each scenario. Signature and content_hash are otherwise valid (as in anc-001/anc-004).",
    "verifier_under_test": "A conformant acdp-verify implementation with a scheme-aware resolution hook registered for seam.decision, given the disclosed sealed-record inputs for the scenario."
  },
