        "behavior": "The recomputed digest (scenario A) differs from the anchor's content_hash. The verifier treats the body as anchor-invalid for its own purpose only; signature, content_hash, receipts and log evidence keep their independent verdicts (RFC-ACDP-0016 §6)."
      }
