      "expected": {
        "outcome": "anchor_cannot_verify",
        "anchor_verdict": "cannot_verify",
        "body_verification_verdict": "valid",
        "behavior": "The record's schema_version selects the construction. A version the verifier does not ship is cannot-verify, never a fallback to v4 or any other formula (registries/anchor-schemes.md, seam.decision notes: Versioning). Not a mismatch, and no effect on the body's ACDP-level verdict."
