  ],
  "notes": "Behavioral; not executed by scripts/conformance-runner.py, which never implements a scheme owner's construction. Conditional: REQUIRED only for a 0.5.0 consumer that resolves seam.decision anchors. Vectors are deliberately kept under scenarios[].vector, not a top-level vectors array, which would route the fixture to the runner's executed anc-* content-hash path."
